Carafe: the settings menu is drawn over an OpenGL program's frame with the frame showing through.
When wine_nx_osk_translucent says the layer is half-transparent, the layer's texture is drawn over the back
buffer with blending by a program of each context's own instead of being blitted.
LGPL-2.1-or-later, as the file it changes.

